      "message": "That\u0027s true, it is valid even if \u0027b\u0027 is empty or unsorted. Since isEmpty() returns true for unsorted I thought that might lead to surprising results, but I\u0027ve reconsidered and I think it\u0027s better to have \u0027b\u0027 treated entirely on its coordinates instead of SkRect\u0027s notion of emptiness.",
